        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>建议、提案格式</title>\n    <style>\n        body {\n            font-family: 'Kaiti', 'STKaiti', 'KaiTi_GB2312', serif;\n            background-color: #F4F1E9; /* Light beige background */\n            color: #000;\n            line-height: 1.8;\n            padding: 40px 60px 40px 40px;\n            max-width: 700px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            font-size: 19px;\n            letter-spacing: 1px;\n        }\n        \n        .main-title {\n            color: #D31D24;\n            text-align: center;\n            font-weight: bold;\n            font-size: 1.25em;\n            margin-bottom: 25px;\n        }\n        \n        .intro-text {\n            text-indent: 2em;\n            margin-bottom: 40px;\n            text-align: justify;\n        }\n        \n        .format-label {\n            color: #CF4E27;\n            font-weight: bold;\n            margin-bottom: 25px;\n        }\n        \n        .template-title {\n            text-align: center;\n            font-weight: bold;\n            margin-bottom: 5px;\n        }\n        \n        .template-note {\n            text-align: center;\n            margin-bottom: 25px;\n        }\n        \n        .greeting {\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\n        }\n        \n        .opening-para {\n            text-indent: 2em;\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\n            line-height: 2;\n        }\n        \n        .list-item {\n            padding-left: 2em;\n            margin-bottom: 12px;\n            line-height: 2;\n        }\n        \n        .blue-note {\n            color: #4075AE;\n        }\n        \n        u {\n            text-underline-offset: 4px;\n            text-decoration-thickness: 1px;\n        }\n        \n        .closing-section {\n            display: flex;\n            justify-content: flex-end;\n            margin-top: 40px;\n            padding-right: 10px;\n        }\n        \n        .closing-box {\n            text-align: center;\n        }\n        \n        .closing-box div {\n            margin-bottom: 10px;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n    <div class=\"main-title\">二、建议、提案</div>\n    \n    <div class=\"intro-text\">\n        建议是指下级部门因为某个重要事项的解决，需要向上级提出解决问题想法的文体。具体写作技巧包括以下几个方面。提案一般为政协提案，具体格式见示例。\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"format-label\">格式：</div>\n    \n    <div class=\"template-title\">关于 xxxxx 的建议</div>\n    \n    <div class=\"template-note\">（“发文机关+关于+内容+文种”）</div>\n    \n    <div class=\"greeting\">\n        <u>各级领导(称谓要根据具体题目要求分析得出)：</u>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"opening-para\">\n        <u>当前，...等问题比较突出(或做了什么工作)，为了做好......工作，提出以下建议：</u><u class=\"blue-note\">(开头为背景分析，指出存在的主要问题和目的意义)</u>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"list-item\">\n        <u>一、......</u>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"list-item\">\n        <u>二、......</u>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"list-item\">\n        <u>三、......</u><u class=\"blue-note\">(主体内容还原为对策题,提出解决问题的措施)</u>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"closing-section\">\n        <div class=\"closing-box\">\n            <div><u>发文机关</u></div>\n            <div><u>xx 年 xx 月 xx 日</u></div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
